  "height": 1080,
  "frames": 3960,
  "duration_seconds": 132.0,
  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C01",
      "text": "王大富拿金条砸我的门时，锅里的毛肚刚下进去。他在门外喊，十根，全给你，开门。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "cc0ff6abaf80ef291fa5c87be4d67d7ad03594291de4a989cb3084dda3ca1592",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 250,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 0
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C02",
      "text": "我夹起毛肚，涮了七下，隔着门回他，当初在群里说我借钱囤货是傻子的时候，你可没这么客气。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e28efc775803ab108fdca22e2d61f0c986773a8fbd493b32f62fbfbe0c154555",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 9.3,
      "start_frame": 253,
      "end_frame": 532,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C03",
      "text": "这是血月降临的第一夜。这顿火锅，我准备了九十天。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "524248254967a329390619930a9f9d7d0d51373812e73a89050fbf743cf53d2f",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.690438,
      "start_frame": 535,
      "end_frame": 676,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C04",
      "text": "九十天前，我还是个被甩锅的仓储主管。马主任说，三十箱货的缺口，签收单上是你的名字。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "873b43ca445479db3f70eb782fc638d16a52baf37ddf1400eb6e095facbdd263",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.788781,
      "start_frame": 679,
      "end_frame": 943,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C05",
      "text": "我说，是你催我先签的。他一把压住单子，问我，证据呢。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5f293dc54b47260f2b5cf0a78fa1c6030cd2e21632335591fdcd6471a611d1aa",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.329469,
      "start_frame": 946,
      "end_frame": 1106,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C06",
      "text": "我摘下工牌，放在桌上。第二天，我就不用再来了。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f25dd65a79124aa5e72fa8fa8747b6a09dbf4359fcaeec7805537af72c0e78a9",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "start_frame": 1109,
      "end_frame": 1256,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C07",
      "text": "我回到父母留下的老房子，梧桐里三栋一零一，连灯都没开。手机自己亮了。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f05cfbb749bbd194fa2b747e6a85c0dda1f720bbbf59fb82e04217db59a8de4a",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "start_frame": 1259,
      "end_frame": 1484,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C08",
      "text": "方舟安全屋系统，已绑定。下面一行数字，一秒一秒往下跳，距离血月降临，八十九天二十三小时五十九分。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "97106f263b99df24dedab16ef4976903792269f77b4ebe5c2945c1cae898455c",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 10.9,
      "start_frame": 1487,
      "end_frame": 1814,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C09",
      "text": "我以为是诈骗软件。直到卧室的门，自己弹开一条缝，白光一直照到我的鞋尖。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "17568b0c1f2160f9633c4fd2b592973680b2b7ee4daf7c935940cf4259e7fdfb",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "start_frame": 1817,
      "end_frame": 2027,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C10",
      "text": "十二平方米的小卧室不见了，门后是一间足有两百平方米的空厅。我扔进去半包泡面，它悬了一秒，无声落地。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b8759804d0883b0a6160794752bd926e7abac55f1f247ec3ce7f017db4f2b490",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "start_frame": 2030,
      "end_frame": 2339,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C11",
      "text": "系统说，屋里的东西不会坏，屋外的怪物进不来。紧接着，一行红字，血月降临后，屋外将不再适合人类生存。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a86053270ad2d35e04636f89b47e2da0a24f0c6e17babfe98b2215ea3a5b2879",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "start_frame": 2342,
      "end_frame": 2648,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C12",
      "text": "我盯着银行卡，四十一万两千。又盯着那行倒计时。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "10f7e925c2240bed154d918b61cca0aee07dfce0a481a9ce644ea8ace2e3a90f",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "start_frame": 2651,
      "end_frame": 2801,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C13",
      "text": "我打开购物软件，搜索，压缩饼干。顺手又买了两盒草莓，一盒放屋里，一盒放屋外，做个对照。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e760d1ff2fa16f068198599efba2d5ca498c31689b3e73c7914b352703d9c53d",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 9.380875,
      "start_frame": 2804,
      "end_frame": 3086,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C14",
      "text": "第二天，我在业主群问，谁有大米，我收五吨。王大富回我，你是要开粮店，还是脑子坏了。满屏都是哈哈哈。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "05cf5761ff3b13aec0efb83aa45c0d2a8911d0365481aa18515de2f46ccc720d",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "start_frame": 3089,
      "end_frame": 3398,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C15",
      "text": "我关掉群聊，心里只有一个字，笑吧。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "483c0c6357c84a8f0b7987034b089947c29fb9b05bc0b62043cf426f2a0adf62",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 3.831313,
      "start_frame": 3401,
      "end_frame": 3516,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C16",
      "text": "当晚，空厅的墙上，亮起一行红字，警告，检测到同类信号，数量未知。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a21c5912d0a2f46d7accf15f3d03965d66acd1288d0ba4cc84d19ccc87551b4b",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.1,
      "start_frame": 3519,
      "end_frame": 3762,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C17",
      "text": "我猛地回头，屋里空无一人。原来，收到倒计时的，不止我一个。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7f4a33eebb8ac34297cfb8a30cf36962a6aca245935dea8495ed32a1050b1b70",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.5,
      "start_frame": 3765,
      "end_frame": 3960,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    }
  ],
